Expected behaviors:
1. `_format_error("f()", Exception('something bad'), False)` → `"Exception: something bad raised in f()"`
2. `_format_error("f(0)", traceback_string, True)` → `traceback_string + "    raised in f(0)"` (traceback string ends with "\n", so result ends with `\n    raised in f(0)`)
3. `_format_error(None, traceback_string, True)` → traceback_string unchanged
4. `_format_error("name check", "NameError: ...", False)` → `"NameError: ... raised in name check"`

